<title>SWITZERLAND: France Telecom to float at least $5 bln.</title>
<headline>France Telecom to float at least $5 bln.</headline>
<dateline>DAVOS, Switzerland 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chief executive Michel Bon said on Monday the first tranche of France Telecom's flotation would be at least $5 billion.</p>
<p>&quot;We think it wil not be less than $5 billion,&quot; Bon told a news conference at the World Economic Forum when asked how much would be in the first tranche.</p>
<p>&quot;Depending on the price and the situation of the market, it could be more,&quot; Bon said.</p>
</text>
